    Conversely, the carbon cost aggregation CCO2 inherently penalizes concentrated tourism pat-
terns through its quadratic summation structure. This mathematical design creates an optimization
landscape where effective environmental management requires both strategic fiscal allocation and
tourist flow distribution.
